      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>Lyra改为FPS</h1><p>作者：温志洪（cnwenzhihong@gmail.com）</p>
        
          <h1 id="总览">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e6%80%bb%e8%a7%88"></a>
总览
</h1><h2 id="这套方案的优点">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%bf%99%e5%a5%97%e6%96%b9%e6%a1%88%e7%9a%84%e4%bc%98%e7%82%b9"></a>
这套方案的优点
</h2><ul>
<li>完全采用Lyra方案，所有安防均扩展于Lyra原生逻辑拓展，如库存、Cosmet、GA、GameFeature、AnimLayer方案</li>
<li>与FPS资产分离。FPS程序化动画可以适配大量只有模型的资产。<br>
<img src="https://gcore.jsdelivr.net/gh/cnwenzhihong/ImageHosting/ProjectMarkdown/20260429151350927.png" alt=""></li>
</ul>
<h2 id="资料">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#%e8%b5%84%e6%96%99"></a>
资料
</h2><p><a href="https://x157.github.io/UE5/LyraStarterGame/">LyraStarterGame Overview | X157 Dev Notes</a>：对Lyra的详细拆解资料<br>
<a href="https://forums.unrealengine.com/t/how-to-send-more-compressed-flags-through-custom-character-movement-component/421142/11">官方论坛上扩展 MoveData 的讨论</a></p>
        
